    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Niall Browne & Co is delighted to present 61 Dangan Heights, a three-bedroom semi-detached home in excellent condition, overlooking a large green area in this established residential development in Newcastle. Extending to approximately 94 sq m (1,012 sq ft), the house combines bright, well-planned living space with ample off-street parking and a private rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers an entrance hallway, a living room with a feature fireplace, a guest WC and an open-plan kitchen, dining and family area. The new kitchen is fitted with a range of shaker-style units, while French doors lead from the family area out to the rear garden. Upstairs are three bedrooms, together with a bathroom with a walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nOutside, a tarmacadam driveway to the front provides ample parking, while the private rear garden includes a paved patio area.\r\n\r\nDangan Heights is an established residential development in the Newcastle area on the western side of Galway city, a location that is consistently popular with families and . University Hospital Galway and the University of Galway are close by, together with local shops, schools and a range of everyday amenities. Galway city centre is within easy reach, and the area is well served by public transport and by road links towards Moycullen and Connemara.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised."
      },
